    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d18">

                <pb facs="0154" n="36" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg36"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Blaine to Mr. Grant.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1889-10-28"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 28,
                        1889</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 29.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your dispatch (No. 37) of the 10th instant
                    relative to the alleged illegal arrest and imprisonment of Mr. Frank Xavier
                    Fisher has been received.</p>
                <p>Your note to the foreign office in regard to the case is approved as in
                    accordance with the Department’s instructions.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James G. Blaine.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
